 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Every night,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 0.737
  },
  {
   "text": "this skinny prisoner pushes his dinner into the wall.",
   "s": 0.953,
   "e": 3.826
  },
  {
   "text": "One dry bean at a time,",
   "s": 4.452,
   "e": 6.124
  },
  {
   "text": "he packs them into a tiny crack.",
   "s": 6.338,
   "e": 8.182
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he pours in his water and whispers,",
   "s": 8.762,
   "e": 11.025
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Grow big.\"",
   "s": 11.513,
   "e": 12.348
  },
  {
   "text": "The guards think he has lost his mind.",
   "s": 13.08,
   "e": 15.024
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Feeding the wall?\"",
   "s": 15.505,
   "e": 16.663
  },
  {
   "text": "one laughs, waving a sausage under his nose.",
   "s": 16.931,
   "e": 19.409
  },
  {
   "text": "The prisoner just smiles and gives the wall his last bean.",
   "s": 20.019,
   "e": 23.378
  },
  {
   "text": "When the warden hears about it,",
   "s": 24.097,
   "e": 25.314
  },
  {
   "text": "he laughs so hard his buttons pop.",
   "s": 25.517,
   "e": 27.528
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Give him double beans!\"",
   "s": 27.968,
   "e": 29.454
  },
  {
   "text": "he shouts.",
   "s": 29.602,
   "e": 30.179
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The wall looks hungry!\"",
   "s": 30.418,
   "e": 31.677
  },
  {
   "text": "So the prisoner gets double.",
   "s": 32.257,
   "e": 33.809
  },
  {
   "text": "And the crack gets fuller.",
   "s": 34.212,
   "e": 35.621
  },
  {
   "text": "Weeks pass.",
   "s": 36.228,
   "e": 37.111
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten thousand beans later,",
   "s": 37.543,
   "e": 39.211
  },
  {
   "text": "the guards start selling tickets.",
   "s": 39.407,
   "e": 40.935
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Come see the Bean Wall!\"",
   "s": 41.337,
   "e": 43.034
  },
  {
   "text": "But one hungry guard keeps stealing beans for his soup.",
   "s": 43.553,
   "e": 46.631
  },
  {
   "text": "So the prisoner shouts,",
   "s": 47.233,
   "e": 48.244
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The wall is thirsty!\"",
   "s": 48.565,
   "e": 49.909
  },
  {
   "text": "The warden grabs a bucket and soaks the crack himself.",
   "s": 50.427,
   "e": 53.35
  },
  {
   "text": "That night,",
   "s": 54.005,
   "e": 54.483
  },
  {
   "text": "everyone sleeps.",
   "s": 54.899,
   "e": 55.871
  },
  {
   "text": "And the wall starts to creak.",
   "s": 56.28,
   "e": 57.772
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 58.567,
   "e": 58.971
  },
  {
   "text": "dry beans soaked in water swell up with huge force.",
   "s": 59.178,
   "e": 62.641
  },
  {
   "text": "Packed tight in a crack,",
   "s": 63.056,
   "e": 64.288
  },
  {
   "text": "ten thousand of them push like a giant fist.",
   "s": 64.544,
   "e": 67.36
  },
  {
   "text": "With one loud crack,",
   "s": 67.802,
   "e": 69.349
  },
  {
   "text": "the wall splits open,",
   "s": 69.629,
   "e": 70.929
  },
  {
   "text": "and the prisoner the warden fed walks right out.",
   "s": 71.208,
   "e": 73.628
  }
 ]
